Top 30 System Design Interview Questions with Real-Life Scenarios and Answers
System Design is one of the most important topics in software engineering interviews, especially for Java, Spring Boot, Microservices and Full Stack Developer roles.

Interviewers don't just ask definitions. They give you real-world problems and expect you to explain how you would design a scalable, reliable system.

Let's learn using practical scenarios similar to Amazon, Swiggy, BookMyShow, Instagram, WhatsApp and banking applications.
